  "ingredients": [
    "1 (15.25 ounce) package butter yellow cake mix (such as Betty Crocker), divided",
    "1 cup chopped pecans",
    "2 tablespoons brown sugar",
    "2 teaspoons ground cinnamon",
    "4 large eggs",
    "1 cup sour cream",
    "0.33333334326744 cup vegetable oil",
    "0.25 cup white sugar",
    "0.25 cup water",
    "1 cup confectioners' sugar",
    "2 tablespoons milk"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Grease a 10-inch Bundt cake pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XGCBAZdP9dbBcklUTw9TXax59Dg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7505-sock-it-to-me-cake-iii-ddmfs-4x3-01-3c42685fda434df4873f1383aec71c61.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7505/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine 2 tablespoons cake mix, pecans, brown sugar, and cinnamon together in a medium bowl; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6J0cvQZMo44XwQYlSmgC7gUx3eI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7505-sock-it-to-me-cake-iii-ddmfs-4x3-02-2c6cc9ab998a4c6fa79a997c993f3c54.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7505/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place remaining cake mix, eggs, sour cream, oil, sugar, and water in a large bowl; beat with an electric mixer on high speed for 2 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FhL9ODLcVKb-J5f-ehQUrtN4sF0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7505-sock-it-to-me-cake-iii-ddmfs-4x3-03-62baa60bfbdc488eb1dbb967f47800c7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7505/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour 2/3 of batter into prepared pan. Sprinkle with pecan mixture, then spread remaining batter evenly on top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AbuKdgpTJfx3iCwpOtOV4pdODDM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7505-sock-it-to-me-cake-iii-ddmfs-4x3-04-df06c350adb84da5bc21763033073b20.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7505/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center comes out clean, about 45 to 55 minutes. Cool in pan for 25 minutes; invert carefully onto a serving plate and let cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/E0vIttNnJyloAjNNj7uH3XleDPY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7505-sock-it-to-me-cake-iii-ddmfs-4x3-05-0f1a9706a0124e37a671329fe298c5b4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7505/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Blend powdered sugar and milk together to make a glaze; drizzle over cooled cake.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MFwSxmt-tH1JtLKpsz4tH928vcE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7505-sock-it-to-me-cake-iii-ddmfs-4x3-06-122bf509333e4e17b2f54250e4f45a19.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7505/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
